OL,5,G1330 Music Map
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch wends her way
OL,7,     Ftowards Brahms' melancholic late
OL,8,     Fmasterpiece. With swansongs from
OL,9,     FFaure and Mozart, there's also
OL,10,     Ftime for a spot of salon carousing
OL,11,     Fin Vienna.
OL,12,G1500 Music Matters: How to listen
OL,13,     F2/3. Conductor Sakari Oramo opens
OL,14,     Fa window into the art of attentive
OL,15,     Flistening. Today, Sakari takes us
OL,16,     Finside the listener's mind, and
OL,17,     Fexplores how context affects how
OL,18,     Fwe listen.
OL,19,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,20,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,21,     Fof all styles as requested by you.
