OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FHannah French is live at the York
OL,7,     FFestival of Early Music.
OL,8,     FPerformances by lutenist Thomas
OL,9,     FDunford and the vocal ensemble
OL,10,     FContre Le Temps, who specialise in
OL,11,     FFrench medieval music.
OL,12,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FFrom the Chapel of The Queen's
OL,14,     FCollege, Oxford, with music by
OL,15,     FDarke, Howells and Bach.
OL,16,G1900 Sunday Feature: A Musical Evening
OL,17,G     at Monticello
OL,18,     FMichael Goldfarb takes a look at
OL,19,     Fthe role music played in Thomas
OL,20,     FJefferson's life.
